# Nar Shaddaa, Mira in the Exile's place (TSL, 301NAR, 303NAR, 306NAR,
# 304NAR): on the way to the Jekk'Jekk Tarr Atton's warning and his
# antidote packs (high influence), Mira's warning of
# the trap (the Exile's lightsaber, she sees, is none) and Atton's scene:
# played as Atton in the cantina, the Twin Suns fought and killed, Atton
# back at the Hawk to warn Kreia and Bao-Dur before the Zhugs come; Mira's
# safe house, her gas, and Mira in the Exile's environment suit at the
# Jekk'Jekk Tarr, played to Visquis's chamber, caught; the Exile wakes in
# the flophouse to Zez-Kai Ell, who goes after her.
# Starts from Visquis's call:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_visquis data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_mira.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Meeting with the Exchange" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit TO_303NAR       # Atton's warning by the docks' door
talk
module 303nar
to tr_303mira_conv   # Mira's warning, then Atton in the cantina
talk
talk
fight 30             # Atton and the Twin Suns
talk
module 301nar        # Atton back at the Hawk; Mira's safe house
talk
wait 10s
module 304nar        # Mira in the suit
talk
use Visquis
talk
module 303nar        # the Exile wakes: Zez-Kai Ell
talk
save nar_shaddaa_flophouse
